              <button onclick="switchNotionDbView18('gallery')" id="viewBtn18_gallery" style="background: #252836; color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;">🖼️ 갤러리 보기 (Gallery)</button>
