                  <td style="padding: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.2); color: var(--amber); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px;">진행중</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: #60a5fa;">📄 02. 정보처리기사 자격증 <span style="font-size: 10px; background: rgba(96,165,250,0.2); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">↗ [열기] 클릭시 문서 펼쳐짐</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(139,92,246,0.2); color: #a78bfa; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px;">자격증</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.2); color: var(--emerald); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px;">취득 완료</span></td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </div>

            <!-- BOARD VIEW DISPLAY -->
            <div id="dbViewBoard18" style="display: none; gap: 16px;">
              <div style="flex: 1; background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); border: 1px dashed var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px;">
                <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 8px;">🟠 진행중 (1)</div>
                <div style="background: #1e2030; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #fff;">📄 카페 아르바이트 경험</div>
              </div>
              <div style="flex: 1; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); border: 1px dashed var(--emerald); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px;">
                <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--emerald); margin-bottom: 8px;">🟢 완료 (1)</div>
                <div style="background: #1e2030; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #fff;">📄 정보처리기사 자격증</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- GALLERY VIEW DISPLAY -->
            <div id="dbViewGallery18" style="display: none; gap: 16px;">
              <div style="flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(96,165,250,0.2), #11131f); border: 1px solid #60a5fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px;">
                <div style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px;">☕</div>
                <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;">01. 카페 아르바이트 경험</div>
